{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Lab Exam Scheduler API",
    "description": "Records **exam scheduling requests** sent by the exam scheduling agent. A request\nis stored with status `requested`; booking a time slot is out of scope.\n\n### Flow\n1. Click **Authorize** and enter the API key (`X-API-Key` header).\n2. `POST /v1/appointments` with an `Idempotency-Key` header and the request body.\n   Every exam code must exist in the catalog and its name must match the\n   catalog name (case, accents and punctuation are ignored).\n3. Sending the same request again with the same key returns the original\n   appointment (`200` with `Idempotent-Replayed: true`) instead of creating\n   another one. The same key with a different body is a `409`. Keys expire\n   after `IDEMPOTENCY_TTL_HOURS` (24 by default); after that the same request\n   creates a new appointment.\n4. `GET /v1/appointments/{appointment_id}` (the `Location` of the `201`) reads it back.\n\nThe contract has no field for personal data: the patient is identified only by\n`patient_ref`, an opaque pseudonym, and unknown fields are rejected with `422`.\n\n### Errors\nEvery error is `application/problem+json` (RFC 9457) with a `type` URI per error\ncode, the `request_id` (same as the `X-Request-ID` response header) and, for\nvalidation errors, an `errors` list with the location of each failing field.\n\n### Example\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8000/v1/appointments \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: $SCHEDULER_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: 3f0c9a8e5b7d4c21a6e9f0b1c2d3e4f5\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"patient_ref\": \"pt_K7Q2M4XZB3C6D7E5F6G7H2J4KA\",\n       \"exams\": [{\"code\": \"LAB-10001\", \"name\": \"Hemograma completo\"}],\n       \"source_document_sha256\": \"9b1e2c4d6f8a0b1c3d5e7f9a1b2c4d6e8f0a2b4c6d8e0f1a3b5c7d9e1f2a4b6c\",\n       \"requested_by\": \"exam_scheduling_agent\"}'\n```",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/appointments": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "appointments"
        ],
        "summary": "Request exam scheduling",
        "description": "Records a scheduling request with status `requested`. Exam codes are checked against the catalog. Idempotent per `Idempotency-Key`: the same key and body return the original appointment with `200`; the same key with a different body is a `409`.",
        "operationId": "create_appointment_v1_appointments_post",
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Idempotency-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 8,
              "maxLength": 128,
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_\\-:.]{8,128}$",
              "description": "Client-chosen key, 8 to 128 characters from `A-Z a-z 0-9 _ - : .`. Repeating a request with the same key and body returns the original appointment instead of creating another one.",
              "title": "Idempotency-Key"
            },
            "description": "Client-chosen key, 8 to 128 characters from `A-Z a-z 0-9 _ - : .`. Repeating a request with the same key and body returns the original appointment instead of creating another one.",
            "examples": {
              "example": {
                "summary": "Key chosen by the client",
                "value": "3f0c9a8e5b7d4c21a6e9f0b1c2d3e4f5"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Request-ID",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "Optional correlation id, echoed in the response and in the logs. Values outside `[A-Za-z0-9_-:.]{1,128}` are replaced by a generated UUID.",
              "title": "X-Request-Id"
            },
            "description": "Optional correlation id, echoed in the response and in the logs. Values outside `[A-Za-z0-9_-:.]{1,128}` are replaced by a generated UUID."
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AppointmentCreate"
              },
              "examples": {
                "two_exams": {
                  "summary": "Two catalog exams",
                  "value": {
                    "patient_ref": "pt_K7Q2M4XZB3C6D7E5F6G7H2J4KA",
                    "exams": [
                      {
                        "code": "LAB-10001",
                        "name": "Hemograma completo"
                      },
                      {
                        "code": "LAB-10012",
                        "name": "Glicemia de jejum"
                      }
                    ],
                    "source_document_sha256": "9b1e2c4d6f8a0b1c3d5e7f9a1b2c4d6e8f0a2b4c6d8e0f1a3b5c7d9e1f2a4b6c",
                    "requested_by": "exam_scheduling_agent"
                  }
                },
                "unknown_code": {
                  "summary": "Unknown code (422)",
                  "description": "LAB-99999 is not in the catalog, so the request is rejected.",
                  "value": {
                    "patient_ref": "pt_K7Q2M4XZB3C6D7E5F6G7H2J4KA",
                    "exams": [
                      {
                        "code": "LAB-99999",
                        "name": "Exame inexistente"
                      }
                    ],
                    "source_document_sha256": "9b1e2c4d6f8a0b1c3d5e7f9a1b2c4d6e8f0a2b4c6d8e0f1a3b5c7d9e1f2a4b6c",
                    "requested_by": "exam_scheduling_agent"
                  }
                },
                "personal_data": {
                  "summary": "Personal data field (422)",
                  "description": "Fields outside the contract, such as a patient name, are rejected.",
                  "value": {
                    "patient_ref": "pt_K7Q2M4XZB3C6D7E5F6G7H2J4KA",
                    "patient_name": "Fulano de Tal",
                    "exams": [
                      {
                        "code": "LAB-10001",
                        "name": "Hemograma completo"
                      }
                    ],
                    "source_document_sha256": "9b1e2c4d6f8a0b1c3d5e7f9a1b2c4d6e8f0a2b4c6d8e0f1a3b5c7d9e1f2a4b6c",
                    "requested_by": "exam_scheduling_agent"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Appointment created.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AppointmentOut"
                },
                "example": {
